<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59138" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορμός</span></b>  (A), ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>trunk</i> of a tree (with the boughs lopped off), <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				23.196
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				575
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HF</u>
				242
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐλάας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					255
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐλάϊνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					431
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορμοὶ ξύλων</span>
			<i>logs</i> of timber, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				154.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ.
			ναυτικοί</span>, i.e. oars, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1601
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ κορμοῦ εἰς κορμόν</span>, in
			measurement of an irrigated vineyard, prob. from <i>block</i> to
				<i>block</i>, i.e. from <i>sluice</i> to <i>sluice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				50.2
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορμολογία</span>.</div>
